# Generated code-analysis output (graph, wiki, cache). Produced by an external
# graphify run, not by anything in this repo, and regenerating it churns tens of
# thousands of lines across ~84 files, which buries real diffs. Kept on disk,
# out of git.
graphify-out/

# Claude Code machine-local settings (the Stop hook that builds and restarts
# the preview server). The hook script itself is committed; which machine runs
# it, and the absolute path it lives at, are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
